    "updated_at": "2025-05-12T15:04:04Z",
    "body": "Also, I saw https://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/issues/227 so I am not sure if there is contention with allowing the path to be nullable before the set a cookie algorithm runs? And I was a bit confused since that PR didnt modify [delete a cookie](https://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#delete-cookie-algorithm) which still includes an \"if the path is not null\"?\r\n\r\nIt seems like a null `path` could be passed into the set a cookie alg if the `cookieStore.delete(options)` or `cookieStore.set(options)` don't specify a path so I included \"/\" as a default if `path` is null in this change. ",
